Package: forexengine
Title: Signal Engine for a Multi-Timeframe Trading System
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Lekgoa", "Komane", , "lionel.komane@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Applies institutional mapping and structural analysis to
    price data and a supplied configuration list, producing signals and
    analysis tables for downstream use. Data acquisition and configuration
    loading are handled by the companion 'forexdatasets' package and
    composed with this package in a 'targets' pipeline.
